出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6EBF7840B3AD7E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1826049009:1":{"text":"つまり、私がテペシュに会っていたとき、<male>奴</male><female>奴</female>も城の中にいたと？","source_cn":"这么说来，我拜访苔佩希的时候，<male>他</mal...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB5462389448A5723","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"つまり、私がテペシュに会っていたとき、<male>奴</male><female>奴</female>も城の中にいたと？","female":"つまり、私がテペシュに会っていたとき、<male>奴</male><female>奴</female>も城の中にいたと？","variant_male_record_index":"251314","variant_female_record_index":"251315","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1826049010:1":{"text":"そうだ。","source_cn":"对。<key:dialog88>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD538E2D3636C18DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1826049011:1":{"text":"それは面白い……","source_cn":"那就有意思了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01858864416CCC9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1826049012:1":{"text":"暗殺は確実に成功したんだな？あの吸血鬼が瀕死の重傷だというのは、間違いないな？","source_cn":"你确定你的刺杀没有失手，那只吸血鬼百分之百重伤垂危吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA533475E24A3215C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1826049013:1":{"text":"ああ……ひどい、じょうたいだ。毒で……血を止まらなく、させた。","source_cn":"她……状态很差。我……用毒，让她一直流血。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC104A55BF4565D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1826049014:1":{"text":"主さまが、言ってた……吸血鬼は、血を失うのが、こわいと。","source_cn":"主君说……吸血鬼害怕，失去太多血液。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73ED804D3BE54DA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1826049015:1":{"text":"よろしい。\n思ったよりは役に立つペットだな。お前の主も、飼っていた甲斐があったというものだ。","source_cn":"很好。\\n看来你这宠物还算有用，你的主君没有白养你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB642867E294BE4E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1826049016:1":{"text":"ぺっと……？分からない。","source_cn":"宠物……？不明白。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30E9E25A1499361A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1826049017:1":{"text":"分かる必要はない。間もなくノヴァリスの主が変わるとだけ覚えておけばいい。その新たな主とは、この私だ。","source_cn":"你不需要明白，只需要知道：诺珐斯即将易主。而我，会是新...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E83F3EBBE4D0182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1826049018:1":{"text":"もう下がれ。私の命令があるまで待機していろ。","source_cn":"退下吧，等待我的下一条命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF890A0AB74C20CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1826049019:1":{"text":"下がる？だめだ……それは、主さまの命令、じゃない。","source_cn":"退下？不行……这不是，主君的命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB40E5B69AFE4585A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1826049020:1":{"text":"それに、<style=\"highlight\">カーマが街の外で……攻撃のじゅんびをしている</style>。","source_cn":"而且，<style=highlight>喀尔马在城外…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DF11D0D8B8B4A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1826049021:1":{"text":"ちっ！脳みそが二つあっても、所詮は愚鈍な化け物だな。私の鞭のほうがよほど物分かりがいい！","source_cn":"啧！真是愚蠢的怪物，他们那两颗大脑加起来恐怕还不如我的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F70377F920614AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1826049022:1":{"text":"お前、カーマたちについていろ。手を出すのは必要なときだけだ。分かるな？","source_cn":"你——跟着喀尔马兄弟，必要时刻再出手，懂吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9814E190269B9DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1826049023:1":{"text":"手を出す……？分かった……","source_cn":"出手……？哦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BE1D5A7E1B9B8A1","variant_status":"","male":"","fe